messages.body:
Hi {{accountFirstName}}, the revised quote is on the portal ahead of Thursday. I've kept the {{secondProductName}} as a separate optional line so you can see the cost if you decide to add it back in later.

Kind regards,
{{brewfittFirstName}}

Hi {{accountFirstName}}, thanks for order {{orderNumber}}. It's booked for delivery on {{deliveryDate}} with {{carrier}}. Could you let us know about access at {{siteName}}, particularly if anything needs to go down to the cellar?

Many thanks,
{{brewfittFirstName}}

Hi {{accountFirstName}}, just to confirm {{orderNumber}} is now due on {{deliveryDate}}. The delivery notes from the original booking have been carried over.

Regards,
{{brewfittFirstName}}

Hi {{accountFirstName}}, an update on the Premium Lager font order. Part of the {{productName}} quantity is in stock and ready to go out on {{deliveryDate}} with {{carrier}}. The remainder is on back order with the manufacturer. My suggestion is that we install at the venues we can supply now and pick up the rest as a second wave.

Kind regards,
{{brewfittFirstName}}

Hi {{accountFirstName}}, a heads up on {{orderNumber}}. The {{productName}} is in stock and will go out for {{deliveryDate}}, but the {{secondProductName}} is currently on back order. We'll send it on separately as soon as it arrives.

Thanks,
{{brewfittFirstName}}

Hi {{accountFirstName}}, the proof of delivery for {{orderNumber}} is now attached to the order. It was signed for at {{siteName}} on {{deliveryDate}}, tracking reference {{trackingRef}} for your records.

Best regards,
{{brewfittFirstName}}

Hi {{accountFirstName}}, a credit note for {{amount}} has been raised against {{invoiceNumber}} for the returned {{productName}}. It should show on your account shortly.

Kind regards,
{{brewfittFirstName}}

Hi {{accountFirstName}}, please find attached purchase order {{poNumber}} for the {{productName}}. Could you acknowledge it and confirm your expected delivery date?

Thanks,
{{brewfittFirstName}}

Hi {{accountFirstName}}, good news: {{submissionName}} has been approved. It will appear in our catalogue once our team has finished the product setup. Thanks for your patience.

Kind regards,
{{brewfittFirstName}}
